 solid #E9EAED;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;font-family:Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1A1A"> <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A">We got your Family Concierge request</h1><p style="color:#1A1A1A">Thanks for your Family Concierge request. Nothing has been charged.</p><p style="color:#1A1A1A"><strong style="color:#1A1A1A">What happens next</strong></p><ol style="color:#1A1A1A"><li style="color:#1A1A1A">We read your request and start the research.</li><li style="color:#1A1A1A">When your shortlist is ready, we&#39;ll email you a secure payment link for $399.</li><li style="color:#1A1A1A">As soon as it&#39;s paid, you&#39;ll get the full shortlist.</li><li style="color:#1A1A1A">If we can&#39;t put together a useful shortlist, you pay nothing.</li></ol><p style="color:#1A1A1A"><strong style="color:#1A1A1A">The terms</strong></p><p style="color:#1A1A1A">Personalized shortlist of care options, with availability and pricing labeled as verified or unconfirmed. $399. We do the research first. When your shortlist is ready, we&#39;ll send you a secure payment link, and you&#39;ll get the full shortlist as soon as it&#39;s paid. If we can&#39;t put together a useful shortlist, you pay nothing. You&#39;re paying for the research and shortlist, not a guaranteed opening or placement.</p><p class="clk-disclaimer" style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#63666A;text-align:left">Questions? Call us at (216) 245-9482. Please don’t share patient details on the line — share them securely at getcarelinkai.com/concierge.</p> </td></tr> <tr><td class="clk-footer" bgcolor="#F4F5F7" style="padding:20px 4px 8px;background:#F4F5F7;background-color:#F4F5F7;font-family:Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#63666A" align="center"> <span style="color:#63666A">CareLinkAI · Cleveland, Ohio · </span><a href="tel:+12162459482" style="color:#63666A;text-decoration:none">(216) 245-9482</a><br> <a href="https://getcarelinkai.com" style="color:#63666A">getcarelinkai.com</a><span style="color:#63666A"> · </span><a href="https://getcarelinkai.com/privacy" style="color:#63666A">Privacy</a><span style="color:#63666A"> · </span><a href="https://getcarelinkai.com/terms" style="color:#63666A">Terms</a> </td></tr> </table> </td></tr> </table> </body> </html>"`;

